{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台表示，一道冷鋒將於明日（9日，周一）初時橫過廣東沿岸，受隨後的強烈東北季候風影響，北風增強，氣溫顯著下降。本港明早將轉吹偏北強風，天氣較涼。分區天氣預報顯示，周一晚上多區氣溫將降至19°C。周二（10日）早上市區最低氣溫約16°C，新界再低一兩度。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.706872+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T03:57:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:44.073911+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:44.073911+00:00","content_hash":"8fcfec4e1eec07ef54f334c73d484c6a213c59290f8a33c6bcd83410662d9e46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}